{
    "title": "Church's Texas Chicken\u00ae",
    "description": "Church's Real Rewards - NEW! \r\nFried chicken has never been this rewarding! Download the app, create your Church's\u00ae account and you'll get FREE CHICKEN (2 pc Leg & Thigh or 3 Tenders) with any purchase. Earn 10 points for every $1 spent and you'll have your choice of rewards to redeem for almost anything on our menu. We'll also celebrate your birthday and your sign up anniversary with a FREE regular side, 22 oz drink or dessert.PLUS, more special offers and member exclusives throughout the year.\r\n\r\nOrder Ahead & Skip the Lines\r\nOrdering through the Church's\u00ae app is the easiest, most convenient way to feed that craving for Church's\u00ae fried chicken that you know and love. You can order for pickup ASAP or for a later time (during a tight lunch hour, on your way home from work or on your way to a family gathering). Park, walk in, pick up your order and you'll be on your way. PLUS you'll earn points automatically with any order in the app when you sign into your  account.\r\n\r\nDelivery That Delivers Real Rewards\r\nWhen you just don't have time to drive to your nearest Church's\u00ae or wait in a drive-thru line, let Church's\u00ae bring your favorites right to your front door. Menu prices are the same as what you'd pay at the restaurant so you'll always get great value.  Plus, we offer a larger delivery area than other delivery services. AND you'll earn points towards free food with every delivery order when you sign into your account.\r\n\r\nChurch's\u00ae Account Saves Time\r\nAfter you create your Church's\u00ae account, you'll never have to type in your name, email or phone number again. Plus you'll have the option of saving your credit card information securely so checkout is a breeze. Previous delivery addresses will also become easy to reuse the next time you order for delivery.\r\n\r\nOrder History Makes Reorder Simple\r\nSometimes the perfect order doesn't need any adjustments and you want what you want. We make reordering your favorites easier than ever - reorder your most recent order or look through your order history to choose from that list.\r\n\r\nSign up for Updates via Email or Text\r\nWe make staying in touch easy, too.  When you create your Church's\u00ae account, you can choose to receive updates about the latest promotions and offers from Church's\u00ae via email or text.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Church&#39;s Real Rewards - NEW! <br>Fried chicken has never been this rewarding! Download the app, create your Church&#39;s\u00ae account and you&#39;ll get FREE CHICKEN (2 pc Leg &amp; Thigh or 3 Tenders) with any purchase. Earn 10 points for every $1 spent and you&#39;ll have your choice of rewards to redeem for almost anything on our menu. We&#39;ll also celebrate your birthday and your sign up anniversary with a FREE regular side, 22 oz drink or dessert.PLUS, more special offers and member exclusives throughout the year.<br><br>Order Ahead &amp; Skip the Lines<br>Ordering through the Church&#39;s\u00ae app is the easiest, most convenient way to feed that craving for Church&#39;s\u00ae fried chicken that you know and love. You can order for pickup ASAP or for a later time (during a tight lunch hour, on your way home from work or on your way to a family gathering). Park, walk in, pick up your order and you&#39;ll be on your way. PLUS you&#39;ll earn points automatically with any order in the app when you sign into your  account.<br><br>Delivery That Delivers Real Rewards<br>When you just don&#39;t have time to drive to your nearest Church&#39;s\u00ae or wait in a drive-thru line, let Church&#39;s\u00ae bring your favorites right to your front door. Menu prices are the same as what you&#39;d pay at the restaurant so you&#39;ll always get great value.  Plus, we offer a larger delivery area than other delivery services. AND you&#39;ll earn points towards free food with every delivery order when you sign into your account.<br><br>Church&#39;s\u00ae Account Saves Time<br>After you create your Church&#39;s\u00ae account, you&#39;ll never have to type in your name, email or phone number again. Plus you&#39;ll have the option of saving your credit card information securely so checkout is a breeze. Previous delivery addresses will also become easy to reuse the next time you order for delivery.<br><br>Order History Makes Reorder Simple<br>Sometimes 